# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Puts on the paperdoll slots findlayer cannot name, from the Razor list named cosmetic.
# Eyewear, back, the two-handed secondary and the rest have no findlayer name
# (content/public/scripting/razor.md part 2), so gear/dress cannot see them. Every profile keeps
# an Arm/Dress list named cosmetic with those items only, added by hand in Razor: gear/dress
# covers the rest, and an older piece left in the list would swap back over a newer one. A
# profile without the list passes this line with no error.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ setup
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
dress 'cosmetic'
